      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PABLO VENDETTA (6) is having his first look at this track. Comes here an impressive winner latest at Warragul in a Grade 4/5 in one of the quickest times of the program (26.15). Well placed and can measure up. BRAVE ISLAND (2) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish a nose away in third (29.90) at Sandown in a Grade 5 over 515m. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Can measure up. ASTON BARRISTER (7) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by a nose at Sandown in a handy 29.89 beating Paw Imperial. The form out of his last race has been franked. Has definite claims. HARTLAND AXEL (3) will run well despite no experience on this track.",
